{"id":"porazhenie","lemma":"поражение","pos":"noun","rank":2347,"glosses":["defeat","deprivation","striking, hitting"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c4/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"поражения","plural":"поражения"},"examples":[{"text":"Мы пока не готовы признать поражение.","en":"We're not ready to throw in the towel yet.","words":[{"g":"we"},null,null,null,{"g":"to recognize"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"unless, until"]]},{"text":"Мы не можем позволить себе поражения.","en":"We cannot permit ourselves to fail.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to allow, to permit"},{"g":"myself","l":"себя"},null]},{"text":"Может, самое время признать поражение.","en":"Maybe it's time to throw in the towel.","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"the very","l":"самый"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"to recognize"},null]},{"text":"Тому пришлось признать поражение.","en":"Tom had to admit defeat.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to recognize"},null]},{"text":"Он не признал поражения.","en":"He didn't acknowledge defeat.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to recognize","l":"признать"},null]}]}